between the two.

00:03:50.234 --> 00:03:52.167
Jake is a YouTube star,
but he's a great fighter,

00:03:52.167 --> 00:03:54.367
and Ben is a former UFC champ.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:57.767
So it's a lot of, you know,
bad blood between these two.

00:03:57.767 --> 00:03:59.901
And they're gonna
get in the ring and get it on.

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:01.901
And this Fight Club
is about that.

00:04:01.901 --> 00:04:03.534
It's about people
who really want to get down

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:05.033
and, you know,
have a great fight

00:04:05.033 --> 00:04:07.434
and not have to wait for
certain rules and regulations.

00:04:07.434 --> 00:04:09.501
But just to get in where
they fit in and fight it out.

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:11.667
So we put that together
because we felt like

00:04:11.667 --> 00:04:13.734
